      "replication_meaning": "Demonstrates correct signal construction (REG = -(R_i - max_j R_j) across 3-digit SIC industry peers), correct VW quintile portfolio construction with NYSE breakpoints, correct Newey-West (6 lag) t-stat computation, and correct risk-adjusted returns across all nine factor models. This is the headline table validating claims C1 and C2.",
